---
// Maintenance retired (T6): the raw blob workspace is superseded by
// /admin/inventory (owner+admin — real search across objects, artifacts and
// system stores, not an owner-only blob browser). `MaintenancePage.tsx` and
// `admin/MaintenancePage.ts` (its island shim) are deleted.
//
// netlify.toml carries the real 301 (force=true, same precedent as the
// /admin/content|templates|studio|media retirements) that serves this
// redirect in production. This route file stays registered in
// `shell-routes.ts` only so a route file exists for the pattern
// (`admin-nav-route-parity.test.ts` lists it in
// ADMIN_ROUTES_INTENTIONALLY_UNREACHED_FROM_NAV) — its own body is a static
// fallback for anyone who reaches the built file directly without the
// netlify.toml rule applying (e.g. a stale cache, `astro preview`).
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url=/admin/inventory" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="/admin/inventory" />
    <title>Moved to Inventory</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>Maintenance has moved to <a href="/admin/inventory">/admin/inventory</a>.</p>
  </body>
</html>
